"g|zh|HSK 1|名量词: 间 (Ruangan)":[["这 ___ 房子 很 大。",["间","个"],"Rumah ini besar.","penggolong ruangan","Zhè jiān fángzi hěn dà.",["口","家"]],["我 家 有 三 ___ 房间。",["间","个"],"Rumahku ada tiga kamar.","penggolong ruangan","Wǒ jiā yǒu sān jiān fángjiān.",["口","家"]]],
