"g|zh|HSK 1|介词: 在 (Preposisi: Di)":[["他 ___ 手机 上 看 电影。",["在"],"Dia menonton film di ponsel.","在 + media + kata kerja","Tā zài shǒujī shàng kàn diànyǐng.",["从","给"]],["我 ___ 家 吃 饭。",["在"],"Aku makan di rumah.","在 + tempat + kata kerja","Wǒ zài jiā chī fàn.",["从","给"]]],
